-- Bounded sets in a metric space: sets of bounded diameter, balls and
-- finite unions, the range of a Cauchy sequence, and images under
-- Lipschitz maps
-- Part of Cumulus, the Grace17 mathematics library.
-- Copyright (c) 2026 Grant Passmore.
